==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|BREAKthrough|Sandshrew|75}} from the {{TCG|BREAKthrough}} expansion; both cards have the Double Scratch attack.
*'''Double Scratch''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Giovanni's Meowth|43}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

